dated on 7 August 2026", (DATE OF 7, 8, 2026), "Total Bonus Rewards is capped at 28,800 yuu Points (worth up to S$144 cash rebates or 8,000 miles) per calendar month.", Provenance OF "dbs-yuu-card-tnc", "9", "Updated on 7 August 2026", (DATE OF 7, 8, 2026), "“Eligible Spend” refers to qualified spend charged on your DBS yuu Card but excludes the following types of transactions:", Provenance OF "dbs-yuu-card-tnc", "9(a)", "Updated on 7 August 2026", (DATE OF 7, 8, 2026), "Any transaction that is subsequently cancelled, voided, refunded or reversed (“Refunded Transactions”) for any reason;", Provenance OF "dbs-yuu-card-tnc", "Appendix 1 — closing sentence", "Updated on 7 August 2026", (DATE OF 7, 8, 2026), "DBS will not award Bonus Rewards on transactions that do not earn Base Rewards from yuu/Participating Merchants, unless otherwise stated.", Provenance OF "dbs-yuu-card-tnc", "6(i)", "Updated on 7 August 2026", (DATE OF 7, 8, 2026), "There is no minimum spend required, and no cap to the Base Rewards.", Provenance OF "dbs-yuu-card-tnc", "7(b)", "Updated on 7 August 2026", (DATE OF 7, 8, 2026), "To earn the following Bonus Rewards, Cardmembers must meet these spend requirements each calendar month (“Minimum Spend Requirement”): i. Minimum S$800 worth of Eligible Spend charged and posted to your Card, and ii. Transact at 4 Participating Merchants. | yuu Merchant Spend 26 yuu Points (13% cash rebates) | SimplyGo 26 yuu Points (13% cash rebates)", Provenance OF "dbs-yuu-card-tnc", "6(ii)", "Updated on 7 August 2026", (DATE OF 7, 8, 2026), "Base Rewards will be credited to Cardmembers’ linked yuu Account in the manner as follows: • yuu Merchant Spend: Within the same day when you scan/link your yuu ID when transacting. • SimplyGo and non-yuu Merchant Spend: Within 60 days after the end of each calendar month.", Provenance OF "dbs-yuu-card-tnc", "11", "Updated on 7 August 2026", (DATE OF 7, 8, 2026), "Cardmembers will be awarded in yuu Points to the yuu Account which has been linked to the DBS yuu principal cardmember at the point of transaction.", Provenance OF "dbs-yuu-card-tnc", "17", "Updated on 7 August 2026", (DATE OF 7, 8, 2026), "yuu Points earned on your DBS yuu Card before linking to the yuu App will be credited upon card linkage. These Points will expire within 3 months (or 90 days) from the day of issuance if the card is unlinked."), Verified
